    "text": "<p>The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8706;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8706;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub></math> of different types of half cells are as follows :<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>(Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> is the electromotive force). Which of the above half cells would be preferred to be used as reference electrode</p>",
